<title>UK: Nippon Steel sets 10 bln yen 4-year bond.</title>
<headline>Nippon Steel sets 10 bln yen 4-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following dual-cuurency FX-linked bond was announced by lead manager Wako International (Europe) Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NIPPON STEEL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     4.90	MATURITY    13.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    13.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.20	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.15	DENOMS (M)  100</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION IN YEN OR U.S. DOLLARS DEPENDING ON</p>
<p>		CURRENCY MOVEMENT</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
